      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Overview",
      "contextAfter": "(A value is *masked* by performing a logical AND operation on it with the [`readMask`](mtlstencildescriptor/readmask.md) value.) The [`MTLStencilDescriptor`](mtlstencildescriptor.md) object defines how to update the contents of the stencil attachment, based on the results of the stencil test and the depth test.",
