      "contextAfter": "The [`stencilFailureOperation`](mtlstencildescriptor/stencilfailureoperation.md), [`depthFailureOperation`](mtlstencildescriptor/depthfailureoperation.md), and [`depthStencilPassOperation`](mtlstencildescriptor/depthstencilpassoperation.md) properties specify what to do to a stencil value stored in the stencil attachment for three different test outcomes: if the stencil test fails, if the stencil test passes and the depth test fails, or if both stencil and depth tests succeed, respectively. [`writeMask`](mtlstencildescriptor/writemask.md) determines which stencil bits can be modified as the result of a stencil operation.",
